406 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Despite rapid growth and technical advancements, on-farm realities continue to reveal widespread malpractices in animal welfare. Dairy animals are routinely subjected to excessive breeding, repeated artificial insemination, and the use of non-therapeutic hormones such as oxytocin - all of which cause significant pain and distress. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
endobj
