415 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Regular review and reform of policies related to cattle welfare in India have the potential to benefit tens of millions of animals by identifying and addressing the root causes of poor welfare. Strengthening welfare standards not only improves the quality of life for animals but also contributes to better health outcomes, reduced suffering, and lower risk of zoonotic and foodborne diseases. Over time, these improvements can also help build public trust in the safety and sustainability of dairy production, encouraging more responsible consumption practices.1 )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0 1]
>>
endobj
