423 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The main focus of this report is to critically examine the financial support extended to the dairy industry - both through government schemes and subsidies, and through loans provided by banks and other financial institutions. This examination is being undertaken from the standpoint of animal protection, environmental sustainability and public health. Therefore, the scoping report required the collection of data through research of various websites of Banks, State Governments and their Departments, the Central Government and its Ministries. Furthermore, statutory laws, rules and regulations, guidelines were also sources of information for the report.)
/E (The main focus of this report is to critically examine the financial support extended to the dairy industry - both through government schemes and subsidies, and through loans provided by banks and other financial institutions. This examination is being undertaken from the standpoint of animal protection, environmental sustainability and public health. Therefore, the scoping report required the collection of data through research of various websites of Banks, State Governments and their Departments, the Central Government and its Ministries. Furthermore, statutory laws, rules and regulations, guidelines were also sources of information for the report.)
