/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The regulatory framework governing dairy operations in India plays a critical role in ensuring animal welfare and promoting environmental sustainability. Aspects like housing, vaccinations, animal husbandry practices, and management of waste material, are components of financial incentives extended and are governed through many statutory provisions. These aspects can be broadly divided into two major categories, i.e., Animal Welfare and Protection; & Environment and Public Health)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
