/T (4. Siting Criteria & Consent from SPCB/PCC: Many dairy units in urban and semi-urban areas do not follow the siting criteria outlined in the CPCB Guidelines. Such dairies operate within residential areas, near schools and hospitals, and adjacent to stormwater drains. This not only poses significant environmental hazards but also adversely affects the welfare of the cattle. In order to ensure dairies align with siting norms, the dairy operators should obtain CTE and CTO from the SPCBs/PCCs.)
